```plaintext
2result.sql
```

Reason:  
• Uses the correct denominator – total number of distinct TCGA‑KIRC cases – when turning counts into percentages.  
• Implements the requested CNV classes exactly (>3 = Amplification, 3 = Gain, 2 = Normal, 1 = Het‑del, 0 = Hom‑del).  
• Ensures true genomic overlap with the cytoband table.  
• Orders output first by numeric chromosome then by cytoband, matching the specification “sorted by chromosome and cytoband”.  
The other queries either divide by per‑band case counts (0result.sql) or leave the chromosome ordering lexicographic (1result.sql), so 2result.sql best satisfies all requirements.